<title>DENMARK: ISS 1996 profits plunge.</title>
<headline>ISS 1996 profits plunge.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to December 30 1996</p>
<p>					  (million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Group net result		-1,856    vs  +20</p>
<p> Group operating result	   619    vs 572</p>
<p>Group net turnover		   15,396  vs  14,391</p>
<p>Ord. result after tax/minorities   -203  vs    +117</p>
<p>Extraordinary items		  -1,653  vs     -97</p>
<p>Proposed dividend (percent)	     0  vs	11</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Danish cleaning and service group is International Service System A/S (ISS). It said in a statement that it expected improved operating margins in 1997.</p>
<p>-Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom, +45-33-969650</p>
